# Broker instrument masters: downloaded and rebuilt at runtime, ~80MB, never
# source. They are written relative to the backend's working directory, which is
# the repo root when it is started through scripts/dev.mjs and node-backend/ when
# it is started on its own - so both are ignored.
scrip_master.json
scrip_index.json
instrument_cache/
node-backend/scrip_master.json
node-backend/scrip_index.json
node-backend/instrument_cache/
